      "text": "Sucralfate:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " duodenal ulcer 1 g four times a day on an empty stomach, continued 4 to 8 weeks unless healing is shown on x-ray or endoscopy; maintenance 1 g twice a day."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
