        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Sucralfate:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " caution in chronic renal failure or dialysis: absorbed aluminum isn't excreted, and accumulation/toxicity (osteodystrophy, osteomalacia, encephalopathy) has occurred. Aluminum-containing antacids may add to the aluminum load."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
